<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-U.S. BEAT SOUTH AFRICA TO WIN HOPMAN CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-U.S. BEAT SOUTH AFRICA TO WIN HOPMAN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unseeded United States beat third seeds South Africa 2-1 to win the Hopman Cup mixed teams tournament on Saturday (U.S. names first):</p>
<p>Singles:</p>
<p>Chanda Rubin beat Amanda Coetzer 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>Justin Gimelstob lost to Wayne Ferreira 4-6 6-7 (4-7)</p>
<p>Doubles</p>
<p>Gimelstob/Rubin beat Ferreira/Coetzer 3-6 6-2 7-5.</p>
</text>
